# Linux-only project (RED OS) — text files must always use LF, regardless
# of a contributor's local core.autocrlf on Windows. Without this, `git
# archive` on a Windows machine with autocrlf=true injects CRLF into the
# packaged spec/shell files and breaks rpmbuild's %prep shell script on
# the Linux build host.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mp3 -text
*.wav -text
